keywords:
  - macOS
  - voice
  - speech-to-action
  - whisper
  - decision-model
abstract: >-
  A macOS app that transcribes speech on-device and turns each locked-in phrase
  into an action through a fast typed decision model, so the Mac acts while the
  user is still talking. Wrong actions are cheap: "undo" reverses the last one.
